        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033920/extras/e5b7af7870877606b4e8fd14ea26635d.avif?t=1772412916\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cursflip – Your obsession starts with a cursor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click. Wait. Collect. Trade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursflip is the best and most addictive cursor clicker/idle game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal? Collect ever more beautiful, rare, and completely ridiculous system cursors – <strong>that you can actually set as your real Windows cursor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How it works:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 2 hours you get a new random cursor  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers: <strong>Common → Uncommon → Rare → Ultra Rare → Epic → Legendary → Mythic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cursor lands in your Steam Inventory as a tradable item  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell and buy them on the Steam Community Market</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clicking is just the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside your virtual PC you run different apps – the more you click and invest, the faster Bcoins roll in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live leaderboards:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-time most clicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most Bcoins collected</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features you’ll love:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly set any cursor as your real Windows cursor with one click from inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop – create your own cursors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join thousands of players who will never look at a normal cursor the same way again.</strong></h2>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033920/extras/e5b7af7870877606b4e8fd14ea26635d.avif?t=1772412916\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cursflip – Your obsession starts with a cursor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click. Wait. Collect. Trade.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursflip is the best and most addictive cursor clicker/idle game on Steam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal? Collect ever more beautiful, rare, and completely ridiculous system cursors – <strong>that you can actually set as your real Windows cursor!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How it works:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 2 hours you get a new random cursor  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity tiers: <strong>Common → Uncommon → Rare → Ultra Rare → Epic → Legendary → Mythic</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every cursor lands in your Steam Inventory as a tradable item  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell and buy them on the Steam Community Market</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clicking is just the beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside your virtual PC you run different apps – the more you click and invest, the faster Bcoins roll in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live leaderboards:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-time most clicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most Bcoins collected</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features you’ll love:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly set any cursor as your real Windows cursor with one click from inventory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop – create your own cursors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join thousands of players who will never look at a normal cursor the same way again.</strong></h2>",
